2DA V1.0
*
# ethren (M3.1, S4): how a new peasant looks, by species and sex (the funnel's rolling screen, FunnelRoll.py;
# the sprites, DCC/Looks.h). ANIM is the animation id (avatars.2da, decimal): the bald body the hair and beard
# overlays go on (0x6501 CPM2 the male, 0x6511 CPF2 the female); the demihumans use the human bodies until
# their sprites exist. HAIR lists the hair styles of dcchair.2da it may take (| between them, a style listed
# twice comes up twice as often); each style is rendered on one rig, so the male rows take only 1-7 and the
# female rows 8-13. BALD is the chance in % of no hair at all (the bald body as it is), BEARD the chance of a
# beard and BEARDS its styles (male rows only: the beards are rendered on the male rig). The colour columns
# are ranges of Ethren's pal16 rows: SKIN, HAIRCOL, the dyes of the minor and major colours (DYES), LEATHER
# and METAL (metal and armor).
            ANIM    HAIR             BALD  BEARD  BEARDS     SKIN   HAIRCOL  DYES   LEATHER  METAL
HUMAN_M     25857   1|2|3|4|5|6|7    15    45     1|2|3      28-35  36-45    7-27   46-51    0-6
HUMAN_F     25873   8|9|10|11|12|13  2     0      0          28-35  36-45    7-27   46-51    0-6
ELF_M       25857   1|3|4|5|6|7      5     0      0          28-33  36-45    7-27   46-51    0-6
ELF_F       25873   8|9|10|11|12|13  0     0      0          28-33  36-45    7-27   46-51    0-6
DWARF_M     25857   1|2|3|4|5|6|7    30    95     1|1|1|2|3  29-35  36-45    7-27   46-51    0-6
DWARF_F     25873   8|9|10|11|12|13  2     0      0          29-35  36-45    7-27   46-51    0-6
HALFLING_M  25857   1|2|3|4|5|6|7    10    15     2|3        28-35  36-45    7-27   46-51    0-6
HALFLING_F  25873   8|9|10|11|12|13  2     0      0          28-35  36-45    7-27   46-51    0-6
